---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHead from '../components/SectionHead.astro';
import { inlineLinks } from '../lib/text';
import { socials, raceDay } from '../site';

const education = (await getCollection('education')).sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
const daysToRace = Math.ceil((raceDay.valueOf() - Date.now()) / 86_400_000);
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Mathematician, actuary, ex-physicist and ex-software engineer. Curious about far too many things, and training for a half Ironman."
  image="/images/IMG_0513.JPG"
>
  <section class="section section--flush intro">
    <div class="wrap intro__inner">
      <div>
        <p class="label">About</p>
        <h1 class="display intro__title">Hi — I'm Erik.</h1>
        <div class="lede intro__lede">
          <p>
            I'm a mathematician who became a physicist, then a software engineer, and finally an
            actuary — a career path that looks like indecision from the outside and like one long
            argument about uncertainty from the inside.
          </p>
          <p>
            These days I work in insurance, where the maths I learned for quantum systems turns out
            to be uncomfortably good at describing claims. From September I'm also reading for an MSc
            in Actuarial Science and Financial Engineering at KU Leuven, mostly to give names to
            things I had been doing by instinct.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src="/images/IMG_0513.JPG" alt="Erik Pillon" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption class="comment">off-season, palm trees, no watch. it does happen.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SectionHead num="01" title="The curious part" />
      <div class="cols">
        <div class="prose prose--tight">
          <p>
            I have never been good at having one interest. The list currently includes reserving
            methodology, the history of science, Formula 1 telemetry, index funds, note-taking
            systems, and how to swim in a straight line in open water. They rotate, but they never
            really leave.
          </p>
          <p>
            The practical consequence is that my side projects follow whatever I happen to be
            obsessed with. A personal finance webapp because I wanted to see my own asset
            allocation honestly. A second brain because ideas never arrive when I am ready for them.
            A pub quiz scoring engine because keeping score on napkins is a solved problem and I
            solved it badly for years.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose--tight">
          <p>
            The other constant is <strong>science communication</strong>. It started during the PhD,
            when I chaired <a class="link" href="https://luxdoc.uni.lu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LuxDoc</a>,
            the University of Luxembourg's PhD students' association, and spent more evenings than I
            can count organising Science Slams and Three Minute Thesis competitions.
          </p>
          <p>
            It now takes the shape of{' '}
            <a class="link" href="https://scientificchronicles.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Scientific Chronicles
            </a>, a newsletter about the people and dates behind the
            discoveries, and its companion archive of scientific anniversaries. I read a great deal
            and take notes compulsively; a fair amount of that ends up{' '}
            <a class="link" href="/writing">here</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SectionHead num="02" title="Off the clock" />
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__value">1:30:37</p>
          <p class="stat__key">half-marathon PB</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__value">70.3</p>
          <p class="stat__key">first half Ironman, 20 Sep 2026</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__value">{daysToRace > 0 ? daysToRace : 0}</p>
          <p class="stat__key">days to go</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <p class="stat__value">3</p>
          <p class="stat__key">disciplines, one of which I can actually do</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="lede stats__note">
        I'm a competitive triathlete in the sense that I compete, and a triathlete-in-training in the
        sense that the swim is still a negotiation. Training is the part of my week that refuses to
        be optimised, which is exactly why I keep it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SectionHead num="03" title="Where I studied" />
      <ol class="timeline">
        {
          education.map((entry) => (
            <li class="timeline__item">
              <div class="timeline__when">
                <span class="mono">{entry.data.dates}</span>
                {entry.data.current && <span class="status" data-status="wip">current</span>}
              </div>
              <div class="timeline__what">
                <h3 class="timeline__qual">{entry.data.qualification}</h3>
                <p class="timeline__place">{entry.data.name}</p>
                <p class="timeline__desc" set:html={inlineLinks(entry.data.description)} />
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
      <p class="comment timeline__note">
        the PhD, in plain language: <a class="link" href="/forum_EP.pdf">a short introduction (PDF)</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <SectionHead num="04" title="Say hello" />
      <p class="lede contact__lede">
        Happy to talk about reserving, running, note-taking systems, or why your favourite economics
        model is wrong. Email is the surest way to reach me.
      </p>
      <ul class="contact">
        {
          socials.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <a
                class="contact__link"
                href={s.href}
                target={s.href.startsWith('mailto:') ? undefined : '_blank'}
                rel={s.href.startsWith('mailto:') ? undefined : 'me noopener'}
              >
                <span class="contact__label">{s.label}</span>
                <span class="contact__handle mono">{s.handle}</span>
                <span class="contact__go" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem) clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .intro__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(14rem, 0.8fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .intro__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.2rem);
    margin: 1.1rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro__lede p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .portrait {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    filter: saturate(0.9);
  }

  .portrait figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 20rem), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .prose--tight {
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .prose--tight > * + * {
    margin-top: 1.1em;
  }

  /* stats strip */
  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 11rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--rule);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .stat {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.1rem;
  }

  .stat__value {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat__key {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .stats__note {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* education timeline */
  .timeline {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .timeline__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 10rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 1.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .timeline__when {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }

  .timeline__qual {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .timeline__place {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .timeline__desc {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 62ch;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .timeline__note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* contact */
  .contact__lede {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .contact {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .contact__link {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8rem minmax(0, 1fr) 1.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 0.95rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact__link:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contact__label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact__link:hover .contact__label {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  .contact__handle {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .contact__go {
    justify-self: end;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact__link:hover .contact__go {
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translate(2px, -2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .intro__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .portrait {
      max-width: 20rem;
      order: -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 44rem) {
    .timeline__item {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .timeline__when {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .contact__link {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5rem;
      gap: 0.2rem 1rem;
    }

    .contact__go {
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }
</style>
